1
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:22,080
Mum, I can’t find my new cap.

2
00:00:22,688 --> 00:00:27,792
Your new cap? What colour is it? It’s red.

3
00:00:28,304 --> 00:00:33,024
Is it in your schoolbag? No, it isn’t.

4
00:00:33,456 --> 00:00:37,600
Oh, here it is. It’s under your desk.   

5
00:00:37,968 --> 00:00:40,384
You need to keep your room tidy.

6
00:00:40,976 --> 00:00:44,192
OK. Sorry, Mum.

7
00:00:48,288 --> 00:00:50,848
I can’t find my new glasses.

8
00:00:51,136 --> 00:00:52,848
Do you see them, Emma?

9
00:00:52,848 --> 00:00:56,672
What colour are they, Dad? They’re brown.

10
00:00:57,424 --> 00:01:00,416
No, I don’t see them 

11
00:01:00,832 --> 00:01:05,280
Oh, wait a minute. Now I see

12
00:01:05,632 --> 00:01:08,000
them! Dad, they’re on your head!

13
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:11,808
Oh, thank you, Emma! You’re welcome.

